"The Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance brings together anaesthetists in the North West of England who teach and practise regional anaesthesia.": ["La Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance réunit des anesthésistes du nord-ouest de l'Angleterre qui enseignent et pratiquent l'anesthésie régionale.","La Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance reúne a anestesiólogos del noroeste de Inglaterra que enseñan y practican la anestesia regional.","Die Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance vereint Anästhesistinnen und Anästhesisten im Nordwesten Englands, die Regionalanästhesie lehren und praktizieren.","La Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance riunisce gli anestesisti del nord-ovest dell'Inghilterra che insegnano e praticano l'anestesia regionale.","Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance, İngiltere'nin kuzeybatısında rejyonal anestezi öğreten ve uygulayan anestezi uzmanlarını bir araya getirir.","Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance samlar anestesiologer i nordvästra England som undervisar i och utövar regionalanestesi.","Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance, இங்கிலாந்தின் வடமேற்கில் பிராந்திய மயக்கவியலைக் கற்பித்துப் பயிலும் மயக்கவியல் நிபுணர்களை ஒன்றிணைக்கிறது.","A Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance reúne anestesiologistas do Noroeste da Inglaterra que ensinam e praticam anestesia regional.","يجمع Northwest Regional Anaesthesia Alliance أطباء التخدير في شمال غرب إنجلترا ممن يدرّسون التخدير الناحي ويمارسونه."],
