"The curriculum, the National Audit Projects and patient information leaflets.": ["Le programme de formation, les National Audit Projects et les fiches d'information pour les patients.","El programa formativo, los National Audit Projects y los folletos de información para pacientes.","Das Curriculum, die National Audit Projects und Patienteninformationsblätter.","Il curriculum, i National Audit Projects e gli opuscoli informativi per i pazienti.","Müfredat, National Audit Projects ve hasta bilgilendirme broşürleri.","Utbildningsplanen, National Audit Projects och patientinformationsbroschyrer.","பாடத்திட்டம், National Audit Projects, நோயாளித் தகவல் கையேடுகள்.","O currículo, os National Audit Projects e os folhetos de informação ao paciente.","المنهج التدريبي، ومشاريع التدقيق الوطنية، ونشرات معلومات المرضى."],
"African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)": ["African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","African Society for Regional Anesthesia (AFSRA)","الجمعية الأفريقية للتخدير الناحي (AFSRA)"],
"Founded in 2010. Workshops, courses and an annual congress across the continent.": ["Fondée en 2010. Ateliers, formations et congrès annuel sur tout le continent.","Fundada en 2010. Talleres, cursos y un congreso anual en todo el continente.","Gegründet 2010. Workshops, Kurse und ein jährlicher Kongress auf dem gesamten Kontinent.","Fondata nel 2010. Workshop, corsi e un congresso annuale in tutto il continente.","2010'da kuruldu. Kıta genelinde atölyeler, kurslar ve yıllık kongre.","Grundad 2010. Workshoppar, kurser och en årlig kongress över hela kontinenten.","2010-இல் நிறுவப்பட்டது. கண்டம் முழுவதும் பட்டறைகள், பயிற்சிகள், ஆண்டு மாநாடு.","Fundada em 2010. Workshops, cursos e um congresso anual em todo o continente.","تأسست عام 2010. ورش عمل ودورات ومؤتمر سنوي في أنحاء القارة."],
"Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)": ["Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","Asian and Oceanic Society of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine (AOSRA-PM)","الجمعية الآسيوية والأوقيانوسية للتخدير الناحي وطب الألم (AOSRA-PM)"],
"Founded in 1989; pain medicine added in 2001. Travelling fellowship and a biennial congress.": ["Fondée en 1989 ; la médecine de la douleur a été ajoutée en 2001. Bourse itinérante et congrès biennal.","Fundada en 1989; la medicina del dolor se añadió en 2001. Beca itinerante y un congreso bienal.","Gegründet 1989; Schmerzmedizin 2001 ergänzt. Reisestipendium und ein zweijährlicher Kongress.","Fondata nel 1989; medicina del dolore aggiunta nel 2001. Borsa itinerante e congresso biennale.","1989'da kuruldu; ağrı tıbbı 2001'de eklendi. Gezici burs ve iki yılda bir kongre.","Grundad 1989; smärtmedicin tillkom 2001. Resestipendium och en kongress vartannat år.","1989-இல் நிறுவப்பட்டது; வலி மருத்துவம் 2001-இல் சேர்க்கப்பட்டது. பயண உதவித்தொகையும் இரு ஆண்டுக்கொரு முறை மாநாடும்.","Fundada em 1989; a medicina da dor foi incorporada em 2001. Bolsa de estudos itinerante e congresso bienal.","تأسست عام 1989؛ وأُضيف طب الألم عام 2001. زمالة متنقلة ومؤتمر يُعقد كل سنتين."],
"Latin America": ["Amérique latine","Latinoamérica","Lateinamerika","America Latina","Latin Amerika","Latinamerika","லத்தீன் அமெரிக்கா","América Latina","أمريكا اللاتينية"],
"Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)": ["Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","Latin American Society of Regional Anesthesia (LASRA)","الجمعية الأمريكية اللاتينية للتخدير الناحي (LASRA)"],
"With ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA and AOSRA-PM, one of the five sister societies behind the World Day of Regional Anaesthesia and Pain Medicine.": ["Avec l'ESRA, l'ASRA, l'AFSRA et l'AOSRA-PM, l'une des cinq sociétés sœurs à l'origine de la Journée mondiale de l'anesthésie régionale et de la médecine de la douleur.","Junto con ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA y AOSRA-PM, una de las cinco sociedades hermanas que impulsan el Día Mundial de la Anestesia Regional y la Medicina del Dolor.","Zusammen mit ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA und AOSRA-PM eine der fünf Schwestergesellschaften hinter dem Welttag der Regionalanästhesie und Schmerzmedizin.","Con ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA e AOSRA-PM, una delle cinque società sorelle promotrici della Giornata mondiale dell'anestesia regionale e della medicina del dolore.","ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA ve AOSRA-PM ile birlikte Dünya Bölgesel Anestezi ve Ağrı Tıbbı Günü'nün arkasındaki beş kardeş dernekten biri.","Tillsammans med ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA och AOSRA-PM en av de fem systerföreningarna bakom Världsdagen för regionalanestesi och smärtmedicin.","ESRA, ASRA, AFSRA, AOSRA-PM ஆகியவற்றுடன், உலக பகுதி மயக்கவியல் மற்றும் வலி மருத்துவ நாளை நடத்தும் ஐந்து சகோதரச் சங்கங்களில் ஒன்று.","Com a ESRA, a ASRA, a AFSRA e a AOSRA-PM, uma das cinco sociedades irmãs por trás do Dia Mundial da Anestesia Regional e Medicina da Dor.","إلى جانب ESRA وASRA وAFSRA وAOSRA-PM، هي إحدى الجمعيات الشقيقة الخمس التي تقف وراء اليوم العالمي للتخدير الناحي وطب الألم."],
"Superficial cervical plexus": ["Plexus cervical superficiel","Plexo cervical superficial","Oberflächlicher Plexus cervicalis","Plesso cervicale superficiale","Yüzeyel servikal pleksus","Ytlig cervikalplexus","மேலோட்டக் கழுத்து பிளெக்ஸஸ்","Plexo cervical superficial","الضفيرة الرقبية السطحية"],
"Thoracic paravertebral or serratus anterior plane": ["Paravertébral thoracique ou plan du serratus antérieur","Paravertebral torácico o plano del serrato anterior","Thorakal paravertebral oder Serratus-anterior-Ebene","Paravertebrale toracico o piano del serrato anteriore","Torakal paravertebral veya serratus anterior planı","Torakal paravertebral eller serratus anterior-planet","மார்பு முதுகெலும்போரம் அல்லது செரேட்டஸ் ஆன்டீரியர் இடைவெளி","Paravertebral torácico ou plano do serrátil anterior","جانب الفقار الصدري أو مستوى العضلة المنشارية الأمامية"],
