"Unintended intraneural injection in 16.3%; faster onset, no injury.": ["Injection intraneurale involontaire dans 16,3 % des cas ; installation plus rapide, aucune lésion.", "Inyección intraneural no intencionada en el 16,3%; latencia más corta, sin lesiones.", "Unbeabsichtigte intraneurale Injektion in 16,3 %; schnellerer Wirkeintritt, keine Schädigung.", "Iniezione intraneurale involontaria nel 16,3%; insorgenza più rapida, nessuna lesione.", "%16,3 oranında istenmeyen intranöral enjeksiyon; daha hızlı başlangıç, hasar yok.", "Oavsiktlig intraneural injektion i 16,3 %; snabbare anslag, ingen skada.", "16.3% இல் எதிர்பாராத நரம்புக்குள் ஊசி; விரைவான தொடக்கம், காயம் இல்லை.", "Injeção intraneural não intencional em 16,3%; início mais rápido, nenhuma lesão.", "حقن داخل العصب غير مقصود في 16.3%؛ بدء أسرع، ولا أذية."],
