"Single-shot femoral block": ["Bloc fémoral en injection unique", "Bloqueo femoral de inyección única", "Single-Shot-Femoralisblockade", "Blocco femorale a singola iniezione", "Tek atımlık femoral blok", "Femoralisblockad som engångsinjektion", "ஒற்றை ஊசித் தொடை நரம்புத் தடை", "Bloqueio femoral em injeção única", "إحصار العصب الفخذي بحقنة واحدة"],
